Source: lys-secrets
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys-secrets
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys-secrets.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/stubbedev/lys-secrets

Package: lys-secrets
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends:
 dbus-user-session
Description: freedesktop Secret Service for the lys desktop
 lys-secrets serves org.freedesktop.secrets: libsecret, Chromium and
 Electron apps, git's credential helper and the portal's Secret backend
 keep their secrets in collections encrypted at rest.
 .
 The package activates nothing by itself, since gnome-keyring may claim
 the same name: enable the user unit with
 systemctl --user enable --now lys-secrets. The D-Bus activation files
 are installed as a reference under /usr/share/lys-secrets.
